1
00:00:00,645 --> 00:00:01,970
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:01,971 --> 00:00:04,742
slide forward controlling uke´s arm

3
00:00:04,743 --> 00:00:07,971
as you do so turn your hip sharply
to break his balance

4
00:00:08,272 --> 00:00:10,572
step forward deeply towards the shoulder

5
00:00:10,573 --> 00:00:13,368
taking his body and balance
all the way down to the mat

6
00:00:13,469 --> 00:00:16,699
as you seat maintain the same grip
on the elbow and the wrist

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,670
with the arms raised slightly above 90 degrees.

